  "persona": "",
  "subject": "A Tainan TV-repair shopkeeper realises the old woman who carries in the same working CRT television every Thursday, swearing the picture is snowy, only wants a chair and her one channel of Taigi opera, so he pretends to tune it, and the week she skips he shoulders a set to her door.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien trip-hop downtempo, hazy Bristol-style noir. Dusty swung breakbeat drum kit with a lazy behind-the-beat snare and vinyl crackle; dub sub-bass with long held roots and slow slides; Rhodes electric piano with tremolo minor-ninth chords; cello and viola section playing slow legato noir lines; muted trumpet with short smoky answers between phrases. Hazy vinyl-crackle mix, deep sub bass, wide strings. Female alto, clear full chest voice, unhurried long notes, clearly sung melody, no whisper. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 92 BPM, D minor. Wry, hazy, a small tender ache in a quiet afternoon shop. No rap, no trap hi-hats, no EDM drop, no autotune, no distorted guitar.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n這間電視店 佇老街仔口\n逐禮拜四 阿婆攏會來\n揹一台 古早的電視\n講畫面 閣咧落雪\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我共電插起去 轉一下鈕仔\n彼个歌仔戲 清清楚楚\n\n[Chorus]\n電視無歹去 無歹去\n伊干焦欲看 十三台\n我共螺絲 轉過來轉過去\n予伊坐佇遮 看到煞戲\n\n[Verse]\n伊坐塑膠椅仔 毋講話\n懷裡攬一罐 烏糖茶\n小旦咧哭 伊嘛綴咧哭\n我佇邊仔 假影咧修理\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n修理錢 我從來無收\n伊留一粒糖 佇櫃台\n\n[Chorus]\n電視無歹去 無歹去\n歹的是 伊兜傷恬\n我共螺絲 轉過來轉過去\n予伊坐佇遮 看到煞戲\n\n[Verse]\n今仔日禮拜四 伊無來\n椅仔空空 茶罐嘛無\n我閣揹一台 電視出門\n行去伊兜 敲門\n\n[Bridge]\n伊開門 講畫面閣咧落雪\n我講 無要緊 我來修\n\n[Chorus]\n電視無歹去 無歹去\n這擺 換我坐佇遮\n伊共螺絲仔 遞予我\n咱兩个 看到煞戲\n\n[Outro]\n十三台 閣咧唱\n畫面清清 無雪",
